<<
/Title (Refer to the Material Safety Data Sheet \(MSDS\) for detailed safety instructions while handling Woodello 1K PU. Store the product in a cool, well-ventilated area away from ignition sources and open flames. Use protective equipment such as gloves, safety goggles, and face masks during application. Avoid contact with eyes and skin; in case of contact, wash immediately with soap and plenty of water. If inhaled, move to fresh air and seek medical attention if discomfort persists. This product contains no added Lead, Mercury, or Chromium compounds and is flammable. Dispose of leftover paint and empty containers responsibly through authorized recycling or waste management agencies.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 350 0 R
